        "In RST, texts are modeled as a hierarchical tree of discourse spans:\n",
        "- **Nucleus**: The central unit holding the primary communicative goal. Deleting it destroys the text's core meaning.\n",
        "- **Satellite**: Adjunct information that supports or modifies the nucleus (e.g., providing reasons, examples, or conditions)."
