        "### TASK 9: Detailed IBM Model 1 EM Trace & Translation Analysis\n",
        "This task trains word translation probabilities $t(f|e)$ over a parallel corpus of disaster updates (English to Regional Language) using the Expectation-Maximization algorithm."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
